        "desc": "An overwhelming stench permeates this horrid lair at the back of a wet\nweb-filled tunnel. Great bulbous egg sacs hang from the white woven ceiling\namidst a sticky mass of strong strands. Several shrunken husks of former victims\nlay lifeless and shrivelled upon the wet stone floor, undoubtedly serving as\nrecent meals at the convenience of the creatures that have taken up residence\nhere. The roof is not visible through the thick webs spun from wall to wall,\nmasking unknown and foreboding heights that lurk above the countless silk\nstrands in the darkness.\n",
